WEBVTT

1
00:00.400 --> 00:03.034
You can show quotes inside a string in two ways.

2
00:03.034 --> 00:06.843
Either you pick the other kind of quotes, or you put a backslash in front.

3
00:06.843 --> 00:14.782
A backslash turns the next character into a special character: [[\n|backslash n]] is a new line, [[\t|backslash t]] a tab.

4
00:14.782 --> 00:21.388
If you want a real backslash, you write two. With backticks, a string can also span several lines.
